    "chunk_text": "\u00e6cedomas \u00fea \u00fee utteon \u00fea yfelan w\u00e6tan & \u00fe\u00e6t sar. \u00deonne bi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6r wyrpe wen. Wyrc him \u00fea sealfe, genim swines rysle, gesmyre ane brade pannan innewearde mid \u00feam rysele, wyl, & bi\u00fe swa betere swa \u00feu oftor edniwast \u00fea sealfe & oftor onlegst. Sio tih\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t yfel ut. Wi\u00fe healsgunde genim weax & ele, gemeng wi\u00fe rosan blostman & gemelt tog\u00e6dere, do \u00fe\u00e6r on. Wi\u00fe sweorco\u00fee wyrc on lecgende sealfe, genim fearres gelyndo & beran smeru & weax, ealra em Eft wi\u00fe \u00feon ilcan, gif \u00feu finde hwitne hundes \u00feost, adrige \u00feone & gegnid & asyft & geheald \u00fe\u00e6t wi\u00fe \u00de\u00e6t bi\u00fe strang sealf & god wi\u00f0 swelcre ablawunge & brune\u00fean & wi\u00fe \u00feara ceacna geswelle o\u00f0\u00f0e Sceal \u00feeah se hund ban gnagan \u00e6r, \u00fey bi\u00fe se \u00feost hwit & micel. Gif \u00feu hine nimest & gaderast \u00e6t fylne \u00feonne ne bi\u00fe he to unswete to gestincanne. \u00deonne sceal mon \u00feone geagl eac swillan gelome on \u00fe\u00e6re adle & swolgettan eced wi\u00fe sealt Eft fifleafan seawes \u00fery bollan fulle lytle sceal forcuuolstan. Wi\u00fe sweorco\u00f0e eft, garleac gegniden on eced \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee sie wi\u00fe w\u00e6ter gemenged, swille \u00feone geagl Wi\u00fe sweorco\u00fee eft, riges sceofo\u00fea seo\u00fe on geswettum w\u00e6tere, swille \u00fea ceolan mid",
